{"time": 1754148425, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1357893868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "开始记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1754148572, "type": "recv", "message_id": "970870099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "冬月的一天深夜，伊芙站在房间的水晶棺前端详着被称为姐姐的人的尸体，沐浴龙血从来都不是易与之事，何况血脉稀薄的末裔，连同着血液进入体内的不只有数不清的毒素，更是充斥着无法断绝的执念。"}
{"time": 1754148603, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1458461205", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那我知道是什么时候了）"}
{"time": 1754148704, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1439581511", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”把绘着卡巴拉生命之树图案的书翻到夹好书签的那一面，一行一行比对着需要的材料"}
{"time": 1754148715, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1165912666", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "关节处的异化自不必说，可怖的深紫色鳞片更是多多少少分布在原本白皙的皮肤上，最为让人无法接受的是光滑的背部突兀伸长了一个尖角的翼翅，带起破皮而出之处深色的大片淤青。姐姐，追寻龙血的进化却变成了如今的样子。"}
{"time": 1754148818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "682195664", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1439581511]翠玉录的第一行就明确标明的人体练成的禁忌之术，记载自然也是残缺不全的，你也不确信，这些材料是否足够"}
{"time": 1754148832, "type": "recv", "message_id": "796353482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "又或者，这些材料能不能真的起到效果？"}
{"time": 1754148962, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1691165106", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……不行”*合上书籍，将其放回桌上，为了排解苦闷情绪咬着自己的头发“能维持现在这样已经不易……不能直接冒险”"}
{"time": 1754149005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1101146951", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“得要试验品……”*先到这里直起身来，戴好兜帽，趁着夜色，带上筹码，准备出门"}
{"time": 1754149014, "type": "recv", "message_id": "811971943", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "冬月的一天清晨，年关将近，这个时候的村庄总是洋溢着过分舒缓的节奏，诺维拉尚在温暖的被窝中休憩，忽然感觉鼻子痒痒，似乎做了个被人挠痒痒的怪梦。[CQ:at,qq=1040972910]"}
{"time": 1754149091, "type": "recv", "message_id": "752296403", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "挠挠鼻子，勉勉强强睁开眼睛，看看外面天色"}
{"time": 1754149169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1309706719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1101146951]门外已有人在等待，那是艾络温家主母分给你的侍从，你记得似乎是叫加雷斯这样的名字。其人穿着执事的衣服，胳膊上搭着一个领巾，看见你出门毫不意外，语气冷漠的开口，“伊芙小姐，这个时间点不应该出门了。”"}
{"time": 1754149224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "44057070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=752296403]睁开眼立刻和对方四目相对，过分近的距离让你一时间被吓到"}
{"time": 1754149315, "type": "recv", "message_id": "329990872", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1309706719]“我有正事”只要他不直接拦在我的路上，就不管他，径直出门"}
{"time": 1754149315, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1200485151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“啊？”看看是谁"}
{"time": 1754149329, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2000546755", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我睡觉也会带发带的（）"}
{"time": 1754149336, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1970767869", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不难受）"}
{"time": 1754149346, "type": "recv", "message_id": "9482859", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(神人)"}
{"time": 1754149375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1403314201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1200485151]被吓的叫了一声"}
{"time": 1754149482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "621786864", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=329990872]\"您最近很痴迷炼金术，这是好事。\"他走到路中央，居高临下地看着你，其人有一双暗色的线瞳，琥珀色在昏暗中明亮异常，\"但是，禁忌就是禁忌。\""}
{"time": 1754149676, "type": "recv", "message_id": "172094666", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1200485151]你突然睁开眼加上大叫一声似乎把对方也吓到了，她条件反射地退开两步紧接着身体不稳跌坐在地上，\"诺维拉，你干嘛啊！\"你这时才反应过来眼前这个穿着厚实棉袄的茶色短发小女孩是你的朋友露莉亚"}
{"time": 1754149677, "type": "recv", "message_id": "413590123", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“禁忌只是庸人不敢探寻先哲留下的宝藏的说辞”*皱眉，暂且停下脚步“不过是将变化逆转，将冰变回水而已”"}
{"time": 1754149738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1080264730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=172094666]\"我来叫你起床，昨天不是约好今天去林子里玩雪吗？\"她坐在地上揉了揉腿，瞪着你"}
{"time": 1754149867, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1049622359", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=413590123]\"庸人自扰吗？\"你看见他勾起微笑，\"如您所言，不知道主母听到这个消息是什么反应呢...\"他似乎是胜券在握，手指有节奏地弹着手臂上挂着的领巾。"}
{"time": 1754150009, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1235093935", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“抱歉，哈哈”挠挠头“昨晚太期待了，导致睡的有点晚，等我洗漱一下换身衣服，露莉亚别坐地上了，地上多冷啊”"}
{"time": 1754150108, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1969669007", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1235093935]\"嗷...\"她慢悠悠起身，拍了拍裤子上的灰，而你掀开被子一瞬间，寒气席卷而入，几乎是生理性抖了起来"}
{"time": 1754150110, "type": "recv", "message_id": "443968650", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“姐姐在时，你敢这么拦她吗？现在她为了你们刚走没两天，便只有我在想着她了。”*略微低头，眼神越过眼镜上沿盯着对方，额角的紫色鳞片一闪而没"}
{"time": 1754150148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "598403915", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(姐姐叫啥)"}
{"time": 1754150256, "type": "recv", "message_id": "361282205", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嘶....”立刻又把被子盖上“好冷啊，感觉我....起不来了”故作虚弱的说到“露莉亚鼓励一下我吧...有露莉亚的话，我什么都能做到”"}
{"time": 1754150261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1913949907", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不知道捏）"}
{"time": 1754150267, "type": "recv", "message_id": "563615541", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那我随便编了)"}
{"time": 1754150267, "type": "recv", "message_id": "927032351", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（也许叫Eva）"}
{"time": 1754150281, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1504866403", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(伊娃也太)"}
{"time": 1754150443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1932301248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=443968650]\"伊莉丝小姐与您不同，为崇高的目标牺牲，是值得庆祝的事情，不是吗？\"他似乎完全不在乎你是怎么想的，\"您不可以出去，主母的命令如此。\"五官中带着明显的愉悦，似乎是挑衅?琥珀色在昏暗中闪烁"}
{"time": 1754150518, "type": "recv", "message_id": "519239239", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=361282205]\"我不要，你不起来我就自己出去，或者找李维他们。\"她扭过头，作势要出门"}
{"time": 1754150521, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1631209083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我觉得我应该也打不过他（）"}
{"time": 1754150602, "type": "recv", "message_id": "386318784", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“别别别，等下我”强忍着寒意换好衣服下床“好冷啊...不止天气，露莉亚也很让我寒心啊”故作悲痛，捂着心脏"}
{"time": 1754150745, "type": "recv", "message_id": "193070852", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“在坐享其成方面，你还真会越俎代庖”*手在口袋里找着瓶子“我不介意让这宅子里值得‘庆祝’的事再多一件”"}
{"time": 1754150783, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2049514495", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=519239239]（那有维斯吗（）"}
{"time": 1754150819, "type": "recv", "message_id": "241729811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=386318784]\"我是第一天认识你吗？\"她的瞳孔是灰色的，此刻显得轻松自若，\"快去吃早饭，你爸妈刚出门。\""}
{"time": 1754150947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "866349206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=193070852]\"看样子我不应该挡在小姐面前呢？\"他几乎是咧着嘴在笑，随后拍拍手，暗处滚出来几个裹着黑斗篷的圆柱体，借着微光，你定睛一看，赫然是前几日和你交易的\"议会\"成员"}
{"time": 1754150963, "type": "recv", "message_id": "171401866", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好的好的”去洗漱，然后看看对着镜子调整一下发带，确保没有松之类的"}
{"time": 1754151032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1589047849", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=866349206]他优雅地退到路边，\"现在是他们挡着小姐的路了。\""}
{"time": 1754151105, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2091354006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=171401866]\"睡觉的时候也绑着发带，到底是什么时候养成的习惯?\"你听见露莉亚的吐槽，声音越来越小，似乎飘去了客厅"}
{"time": 1754151140, "type": "recv", "message_id": "148059483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我太喜欢了么，不要在意这种小事啦...”"}
{"time": 1754151167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "336833655", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那么接下来去吃早餐喽(´๑•ω•๑`)"}
{"time": 1754151188, "type": "recv", "message_id": "878023336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“露莉亚吃过早饭了吗，没吃的话可以一起吃哦”"}
{"time": 1754151366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "421284485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1589047849]“……我保证这是我最后一次听见你们冒犯她的名字”*面色不快地拿出货码“5支无味水毒，5支危险剂量，5支无色眠香……除去上次的量，多余的，给我弄些试验品回来”"}
{"time": 1754151366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1167791205", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我当然吃过了。\"你分明看见她似乎在偷偷打量桌上冒着热气的甜菜汤"}
{"time": 1754151463, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2104016898", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这汤好多啊，我一个人喝不下，你帮我喝点吧，好不好么，伟大的露莉亚小姐，求求你了”双手十指相扣面对露莉亚"}
{"time": 1754151503, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1128905039", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=421284485]\"他们没有那个资格。\"加雷斯看着你的动作，走到你身旁缓缓开口，\"他们也不会有那个机会了，小姐能明白吗？\"你感觉到一股凉意从背后升起"}
