{"time": 1754155220, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2140301215", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "那几个躺在地上的家伙也一起消失了"}
{"time": 1754155304, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1761293387", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "排除了阅后即焚的可能性，也只能把纸张收好。随后换一身没有图案特征的黑袍，去找自己的黑手套"}
{"time": 1754155353, "type": "recv", "message_id": "279839457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1299772436]她跑得很快，你追不上她，只能看见她的身影在林子深处越来越小"}
{"time": 1754155388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "36862158", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你慢点啊....等等我露莉亚，别丢我一个人...”"}
