{"time": 1754155582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "319337473", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1617961435]\"呼喵...\"从背影看她一直点着脑袋，\"💤\"似乎是睡着了？"}
{"time": 1754155639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "977686507", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？怎么站着睡着了？”靠近去看看"}
{"time": 1754155776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "745665608", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你靠近的一瞬间，她迅速转身，手里捏着的雪球精准地砸到你的脸上，\"咯咯咯，诺维拉真好骗啊。\""}
{"time": 1754155798, "type": "recv", "message_id": "399392000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”*整理好表情，看向待命的几人“毒牙们，说不定这就是我和伊莉丝此生仅有的机会了。城西70里的村子里，有纯粹的精神元素——贤者之石。我不需要它，但伊莉丝需要，艾络温也需要它”"}
{"time": 1754155855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1189918314", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不管了，直接手放她脸上“你这么欺负我，那帮我暖暖手，快冻死我了”"}
{"time": 1754155955, "type": "recv", "message_id": "727367963", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=399392000]\"主上做好决定了吗？\"几人都蒙着面，跪在你四周"}
{"time": 1754156004, "type": "recv", "message_id": "235469524", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1189918314]\"诶诶...\"她费劲要把你推开，\"好冰啊!\""}
{"time": 1754156114, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1484792300", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“都起身吧……今晚，不计代价，不容有失。务必将贤者之石拿到手”*无从顾及情报真伪，正如溺死之人无暇顾及绳索的另一端是否绑着东西"}
{"time": 1754156184, "type": "recv", "message_id": "196326311", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“只有冰冰的感觉吗，露莉亚没有感受到我火热的复仇之心吗”揉一揉"}
{"time": 1754156217, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1209157876", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"主上，夜间大雪，这条路明天上午才会开通。\"几人陆续站起来，互相看了看，由最前面的那个人开口"}
{"time": 1754156252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2137008601", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，难道不能夜袭吗）"}
{"time": 1754156278, "type": "recv", "message_id": "545941674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=196326311]\"我才不管咧。\"她的手立刻按到了你的脸上，还有继续往下到颈子里的趋势"}
{"time": 1754156286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1372947494", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2137008601](你可以走过去啊)"}
{"time": 1754156302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1034628380", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（对啊）"}
{"time": 1754156313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1400876722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不过我感觉下雪天走70里山路)"}
{"time": 1754156319, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1567471825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你走到也早上了吧)"}
{"time": 1754156326, "type": "recv", "message_id": "232269646", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎）"}
{"time": 1754156333, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1036622473", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那也行吧）"}
{"time": 1754156360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1816526078", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你...你要干嘛”抓住她的手“很冰的了...”"}
{"time": 1754156366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1290483514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(下雪当然是故意的，jpg)"}
{"time": 1754156420, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1688843127", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1816526078]\"现在暖和了。\"她的手自得地放在你的脖颈间，满意地哼了两声"}
{"time": 1754156430, "type": "recv", "message_id": "472472885", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……那就步行出发，尽早。我和你们一起去”*找出几支驱寒的药剂"}
{"time": 1754156487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "813286721", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“露莉亚...太狡猾了...”冷的直打颤"}
{"time": 1754156495, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2068516031", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"明白。\"几人披上厚重的斗篷，离开去了城堡的一处墙边等你。"}
{"time": 1754156515, "type": "recv", "message_id": "101739885", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(给你准备东西的时间，jpg)"}
{"time": 1754156584, "type": "recv", "message_id": "956228300", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我能准备什么呢，无非是大范围迷烟，热饮和不得已之时的杀伤性毒物对不对）"}
{"time": 1754156605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "896058796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(没意见)"}
