{"time": 1754156663, "type": "recv", "message_id": "930610293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=813286721]过了一会，她似乎是终于满意了，把手抽了出来，\"好啦，不知不觉都跑了这么远，堆个雪人啦。\""}
{"time": 1754156694, "type": "recv", "message_id": "886075497", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好啊，我们一起堆一个吧”"}
{"time": 1754156728, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1687137389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*带好5人份的驱寒药物，迷烟、解药和体力补剂。还有两颗毒烟雾球。就此出发"}
{"time": 1754156960, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1597904665", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "艾络温家的驻地其实也说不上很繁华的地段，你带着一行人离开了城堡，很快就走到了杳无人烟的小路上，积雪微微没过脚踝。"}
{"time": 1754156971, "type": "recv", "message_id": "165744306", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=886075497](那你堆)"}
{"time": 1754156975, "type": "recv", "message_id": "546368671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "和露莉亚一人滚一个雪球，然后组合起来"}
{"time": 1754157025, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1441504028", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "找两个树枝充当雪人的手臂，小石子充当眼睛和鼻子，然后手画一个嘴"}
{"time": 1754157043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1246042036", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，丑萌丑萌的，给它起个名字吧”"}
{"time": 1754157059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1456775085", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（荷莱露，我为你带来毁灭了）"}
{"time": 1754157101, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1916006977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“就叫露莉亚吧”"}
{"time": 1754157168, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1997511864", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"明明是诺维拉啦。\"附近的雪似乎有些加剧"}
{"time": 1754157195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1496253753", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "露莉亚吹了吹通红的手心，\"回去吧?要中午了感觉\""}
{"time": 1754157234, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1614173914", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "搓搓自己的手然后抓住她的手“我帮你暖和暖和”"}
{"time": 1754157258, "type": "recv", "message_id": "402860138", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，时间过得还真快啊，那就回去吧”"}
{"time": 1754157258, "type": "recv", "message_id": "160317209", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1597904665]你们整夜行军，但是教程被你有所拖累，预计早上到达的时间，你们到达时已经到了上午。"}
